@baseUrl = http://localhost:5261
@deliveryId = d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@courierId = c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Inspect delivery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}

### Assign courier (the demo delivery can be assigned once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/courier-assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "{{courierId}}"
}
